sequenceDiagram
  participant Buy as BUY workflow
  participant Trading as Trading port
  participant CEX
  participant Ledger as Fill / inventory ledger
  participant Policy as SELL approval
  participant Sell as SELL workflow

  Buy->>Trading: Request cancel of prior recovery SELL
  Trading->>CEX: Cancel request
  CEX-->>Trading: Cancel result (not final proof)
  Sell->>Trading: Query final order + complete fills
  Trading->>CEX: Order/history queries
  CEX-->>Trading: Final status and executions
  Trading-->>Sell: Reconciled canonical facts
  Sell->>Ledger: Apply missing fills; adjust reservation
  Sell->>Policy: Evaluate exact active inventory and recovery amount
  Policy-->>Sell: Approved intent or refusal reason
  alt approved and market safe
    Sell->>Trading: Submit replacement SELL
    Trading->>CEX: Limit order
    CEX-->>Trading: Ack / rejection / unknown
  else not approved
    Sell-->>Ledger: Keep state safe; no forced sale
  end
  Note over Ledger,Policy: Free quantity is allocated only after a fully filled profitable recovery SELL